61	\label{sec:stage2}
62	
63	The recovery-aware score combines importance and functional overlap:
64	\begin{equation}
65	    S(h) = I(h) \times \big(1 - F(h)\big)^\alpha,
66	    \label{eq:score}
67	\end{equation}
